  "conclusion": "corresponds",
  "rationale": "Name has separate global and nominal-qualified method constructors. Parameter uses FieldType, hence a permission and whole nominal type; Signature has an ordered parameter list and optional result. receiver fixes the name self and enclosing nominal type. Signature.WellFormed checks distinct names, Admissible types, forbids self in global parameters, and requires the first method parameter be self at the owner type with no later self. Shared kind validity supplies the class/ordinary-struct/shared-struct boundaries. The grammar and explicit Unicode prefixes describe this abstract representation, not parsing.",
